{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46202","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十六 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一庵冥目在穹冥，菌枕松牀藓阵青。\n乳鹿暗行柽径雪，瀑泉微溅石楼经。\n闲行不觉过天井，长啸深能动岳灵。\n应恐无人知此意，非凡非圣独醒醒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}